WEBVTT

01:42.018 --> 01:46.940
BAMBI IS ALIVE AND WELL

01:47.023 --> 01:48.525
KINES INGREDIENT ANALYSIS

01:51.653 --> 01:54.531
Myosin, actin, myogen.

01:54.614 --> 01:58.326
Tongkat, maca phosphate.

01:58.409 --> 01:59.244
This is it.

01:59.828 --> 02:02.413
<i>Those are components of meat and bones.</i>

02:02.497 --> 02:05.333
This is being sold to the public?

02:05.416 --> 02:08.128
No wonder the effects
are similar to meat intoxication.

02:08.211 --> 02:11.965
<i>But the amount isn't enough
to cause meat intoxication.</i>

02:12.048 --> 02:15.718
Really? Could there be
something else causing it?

02:15.802 --> 02:19.097
<i>Yes. It must be reacting
with some other substance</i>

02:19.180 --> 02:21.724
<i>and stimulating
the central nervous system.</i>

02:22.600 --> 02:24.269
Some kind of catalyst?

02:24.769 --> 02:30.066
<i>Well, the drink doesn't affect herbivores,</i>

02:30.150 --> 02:32.986
<i>so it must react
to something only carnivores have.</i>

02:33.069 --> 02:34.279
What could it be?

02:34.362 --> 02:36.865
<i>That's outside my expertise.</i>

02:36.948 --> 02:39.993
<i>But I know a researcher who could help.</i>

02:40.076 --> 02:41.703
Does he work there?

02:42.203 --> 02:46.583
<i>No, he works somewhere else. The thing is...</i>

02:48.251 --> 02:49.252
What is it?

02:49.335 --> 02:52.338
<i>As good as he is,
he's a bit of a shady character.</i>

02:52.422 --> 02:54.048
Can you introduce me to--

02:56.759 --> 02:57.719
<i>What is it?</i>

02:58.428 --> 03:01.014
<i>What's wrong? What happened?</i>

03:01.097 --> 03:02.015
<i>Are you okay?</i>

03:02.098 --> 03:03.182
<i>Louis!</i>

03:05.894 --> 03:09.731
I'm okay. Tell me how to reach him.

03:15.111 --> 03:16.237
<i>What was that?</i>

03:17.989 --> 03:21.075
<i>I fed Legoshi
everything from the knee down.</i>

03:22.869 --> 03:25.413
<i>Could this mean...
something happened to Legoshi?</i>

03:27.123 --> 03:28.875
CALL ENDED

03:28.958 --> 03:30.251
KOPI LUWAK RESEARCH CENTER
DESHICO

03:30.335 --> 03:31.586
HAPPY & HEAVEN
JUNGLE THEATER

03:31.669 --> 03:33.171
I said I don't know!

03:33.254 --> 03:36.507
You really don't know about the wolf?

03:36.591 --> 03:40.553
I told you.
We only did what the owner said.

03:40.637 --> 03:44.140
You think we're just gonna say,
"Oh, okay. See ya." and let you go?

03:44.224 --> 03:46.392
How dumb do you think we are?

03:46.476 --> 03:49.312
Too dumb to understand
what we're saying, clearly!

03:49.395 --> 03:50.230
What?

03:50.313 --> 03:51.898
Listen.

03:51.981 --> 03:55.526
We don't want to do anything
that would hurt those perfect bodies.

03:56.027 --> 03:58.446
Just tell us. It'll be easier.

03:59.030 --> 04:00.615
We don't know anything!

04:02.825 --> 04:04.452
If you say so.

04:05.119 --> 04:06.955
That's enough of that.

04:09.958 --> 04:12.877
We can't go home empty-handed, you see?

04:15.171 --> 04:19.133
You weren't here when we got here.

04:20.551 --> 04:21.427
Got it?

04:22.428 --> 04:27.058
We promised our old boss
that we'd protect you girls.

04:27.558 --> 04:30.687
Your old boss? That little deer?

04:30.770 --> 04:33.231
The Shishi-Gumi keeps its promises.

04:37.402 --> 04:39.279
We'll find another souvenir.

04:42.407 --> 04:45.034
Hey, he told us to kill them, didn't he?

04:45.118 --> 04:46.494
You sure about this?

04:48.121 --> 04:49.580
We did the right thing.

05:05.013 --> 05:08.891
<i>Zoozle Maps should really have
an "avoid Black Market" option.</i>

05:08.975 --> 05:09.976
<i>Damn.</i>

05:10.560 --> 05:12.854
<i>I'll be in trouble if they spot me.</i>

05:31.581 --> 05:33.374
<i>This thing needs maintenance.</i>

05:43.259 --> 05:44.135
Boss.

05:47.764 --> 05:51.184
Do you remember our final agreement?

05:52.894 --> 05:55.688
If I ever saw you
at the Black Market again,

05:55.772 --> 05:57.231
I'd kill you.

05:58.608 --> 06:02.070
Yes. It seems I've broken that agreement.

06:03.154 --> 06:04.155
Shoot me.

06:05.865 --> 06:08.910
<i>Damn it...
Why does this always happen to me?</i>

06:09.869 --> 06:11.037
<i>Don't hesitate.</i>

06:12.914 --> 06:17.293
<i>First Ibuki, now him.
Why do I have to kill everyone?</i>

06:18.795 --> 06:21.089
<i>Don't make that face.</i>

06:21.631 --> 06:23.549
<i>You're the king of the beasts, right?</i>

06:23.633 --> 06:26.052
<i>That calm expression.</i>

06:27.136 --> 06:31.224
<i>You always were an amazing boss.</i>

06:47.031 --> 06:49.033
<i>Shedding my antlers?</i>

06:49.659 --> 06:51.661
<i>Is it that time of year already?</i>

06:53.121 --> 06:54.747
Sorry to distract you.

06:54.831 --> 06:55.706
Go ahead.

06:59.919 --> 07:03.172
"The next time I see you, you're dead."

07:03.256 --> 07:05.174
That was our deal.

07:06.092 --> 07:09.971
But we can't recognize you
looking like that!

07:14.350 --> 07:15.685
I missed you!

07:15.768 --> 07:16.769
Hey.

07:17.353 --> 07:19.439
- You'll kill him.
- You big oaf.

07:20.606 --> 07:21.607
Cut it out.

07:28.614 --> 07:31.409
You look like a little fawn like this.

07:31.492 --> 07:32.785
Shut up.

07:32.869 --> 07:35.955
What a waste. These things are cool.

07:36.706 --> 07:38.374
What do you do with these?

07:38.458 --> 07:39.959
You can keep them.

07:40.460 --> 07:43.504
All right! Thanks, Ex-boss!

07:44.130 --> 07:47.258
On that note,
do you have any other injuries?

07:47.341 --> 07:48.968
You were walking funny.

07:49.677 --> 07:51.596
Yeah. I lost my right leg.

07:51.679 --> 07:53.181
What?

07:57.101 --> 08:00.771
Since I shed my antlers,
I'm used to losing parts of my body.

08:01.355 --> 08:02.607
It's no big deal.

08:03.816 --> 08:04.692
But forget about me.

08:05.943 --> 08:08.946
You guys are looking
a bit haggard yourself.

08:11.449 --> 08:15.161
We're only allowed
to eat meat twice a month.

08:15.244 --> 08:17.914
That's the Shishi-Gumi's new rule.

08:18.748 --> 08:22.251
If we tried to sneak meat past him,
we'd get caught right away and...

08:24.086 --> 08:25.087
Him?

08:25.171 --> 08:27.882
So, what were you doing
at the Black Market?

08:29.425 --> 08:32.512
I was looking for Kopi La... Wait...

08:34.514 --> 08:36.224
- Kopi Luwak?
- Kopi Luwak?

08:38.184 --> 08:40.978
- Have you heard of it?
- Yeah.

08:44.190 --> 08:45.066
It's the boss!

08:45.149 --> 08:46.234
He's early.

08:54.492 --> 08:57.245
I know this reeks,
but it'll mask your scent so you can hide.

09:09.966 --> 09:13.719
I have a little souvenir
for you kitty cats.

09:17.848 --> 09:21.686
He was a useless security guard,

09:21.769 --> 09:24.146
but might make for a nice decoration.

09:25.815 --> 09:26.816
Well, then.

09:26.899 --> 09:29.694
Where's my stripper steak?

09:30.695 --> 09:33.864
<i>A gazelle? But he has fangs.</i>

09:34.365 --> 09:35.741
<i>Is he a mix?</i>

09:38.494 --> 09:41.289
What the hell is this?

09:42.373 --> 09:48.462
The strippers made a run for it,
so we made the owner pay instead.

09:50.256 --> 09:55.303
Do you really think this counts as dinner?

09:55.386 --> 09:57.972
That place makes us a lot of money.

09:58.556 --> 10:03.269
And the Shishi-Gumi isn't desperate enough
to eat those who are part of our turf.

10:06.647 --> 10:09.191
I'm impressed.

10:09.275 --> 10:14.697
You really put a lot of thought into this.

10:22.788 --> 10:26.834
Agata the Congo lion, age 26.

10:26.917 --> 10:30.296
Youngest member of the Shishi-Gumi.

10:32.548 --> 10:36.802
Flaunting an ethical stance so limp
it doesn't even serve as pretense.

10:36.886 --> 10:39.764
You boring lion boy.

10:40.890 --> 10:41.766
Hey, Free.

10:42.475 --> 10:43.392
Yes?

10:43.934 --> 10:46.395
There's an outsider here, isn't there?

10:49.023 --> 10:52.777
How dumb do you think I am?

10:53.402 --> 10:56.489
You don't think I can smell it?

11:00.493 --> 11:04.955
Don't just sit there,
hurry up and bring him to me.

11:06.248 --> 11:10.336
Him or Agata?
Who would you rather eat tonight?

11:10.419 --> 11:12.713
Answer me.

11:13.881 --> 11:15.049
<i>I have to show myself.</i>

11:15.633 --> 11:17.259
Forgive me.

11:30.523 --> 11:33.943
I knew it was the smell of deer.

11:34.026 --> 11:39.198
It looks awfully fresh
with that blood on it, Miguel.

11:39.949 --> 11:42.243
I went against your word,

11:42.326 --> 11:44.036
fell prey to my desires,

11:44.537 --> 11:47.289
and ate a deer at the Black Market.

11:48.499 --> 11:49.625
I have no excuse.

11:50.334 --> 11:51.794
There's nothing I can say.

11:52.628 --> 11:56.340
Carnivores are simply foolish creatures.

11:57.508 --> 11:58.759
That's all!

11:59.343 --> 12:01.929
As a carnivore and herbivore mix,

12:02.012 --> 12:04.432
you are a complete being.

12:05.015 --> 12:07.101
I am but a mere lion.

12:07.810 --> 12:12.106
I couldn't even follow
the simple twice-a-month rule.

12:13.274 --> 12:15.985
If you would grant me one more chance,

12:16.068 --> 12:19.238
I'll swear off all meat

12:19.321 --> 12:23.534
and try my best
to become a complete being like yourself!

12:26.287 --> 12:29.248
Not bad for a fool.

12:32.251 --> 12:35.754
I was hoping to enjoy dinner,

12:35.838 --> 12:39.008
but Yahya's found out
I've been working with you.

12:39.091 --> 12:41.677
No point staying here any longer.

12:46.765 --> 12:48.309
KOPI LUWAK RESEARCH CENTER

12:49.477 --> 12:51.312
I've been so forgetful lately.

12:51.896 --> 12:56.817
You have the weak handwriting
of an herbivore.

13:07.912 --> 13:09.788
That was really something.

13:09.872 --> 13:11.957
I didn't know you grovel like that.

13:13.334 --> 13:14.335
It was nothing.

13:18.881 --> 13:20.049
You guys...

13:21.300 --> 13:23.177
Don't thank us.

13:23.260 --> 13:25.763
We just didn't want
to lose our pride as lions.

13:28.224 --> 13:30.100
Are you going to Kopi Luwak?

13:30.768 --> 13:31.769
Yeah.

13:32.353 --> 13:33.562
I'm looking into Kines.

13:38.025 --> 13:40.945
CENTRAL HOSPITAL
LARGE ANIMAL WARD

14:04.593 --> 14:06.011
<i>That's right.</i>

14:06.095 --> 14:07.471
<i>I was shot by Melon...</i>

14:08.347 --> 14:10.266
<i>and brought here, I guess.</i>

14:14.603 --> 14:15.604
<i>Is that me?</i>

14:32.204 --> 14:36.500
<i>Am I in limbo or something?</i>

14:38.002 --> 14:40.629
<i>Am I going to die?</i>

14:42.172 --> 14:45.676
If I had known this would happen, I...

14:46.510 --> 14:49.263
I would've kissed Haru back then!

14:49.346 --> 14:51.640
Haru...

14:52.683 --> 14:55.269
Would she cry if she found out I died?

14:56.103 --> 14:58.522
No, I bet she'd be mad.

15:02.401 --> 15:05.154
<i>Isn't it a bit soon to be giving up?</i>

15:05.237 --> 15:08.073
I mean, look at this mess.

15:18.459 --> 15:19.710
Mom?

15:22.421 --> 15:28.218
<i>Am I actually talking to my mother
who died six years ago?</i>

15:28.844 --> 15:31.513
You're all grown up, Legoshi.

15:33.390 --> 15:34.892
This is...

15:38.479 --> 15:39.730
You're so careless.

15:39.813 --> 15:43.484
You used to be a good boy.
Now you're getting yourself into danger.

15:43.984 --> 15:46.654
- I...
- Don't make me worry like that.

15:47.237 --> 15:48.238
I'm sorry.

15:49.073 --> 15:54.036
Melon called himself a freak of nature.
It just didn't sit right with me.

15:54.119 --> 15:56.705
I mean, you're a mix too, Mom.

15:56.789 --> 16:02.044
If Haru and I were to have a child,
it'd be a mix as well.

16:02.753 --> 16:04.296
Do you think our child...

16:05.130 --> 16:07.508
would call itself a freak...?

16:08.634 --> 16:11.220
Well, we are freaks.

16:20.729 --> 16:21.981
Hey.

16:22.064 --> 16:24.608
You haven't eaten or drunk anything
in five days.

16:29.446 --> 16:32.324
<i>Your grandfather is a Komodo dragon.</i>

16:32.408 --> 16:34.493
Your grandmother, a gray wolf.

16:35.202 --> 16:37.579
And I was their child.

16:38.706 --> 16:42.626
<i>With a mix as strange as that,
naturally, everyone was curious.</i>

16:43.293 --> 16:45.879
<i>They wanted to see
how ugly a creature would be born.</i>

16:47.464 --> 16:49.466
But, as you can see,

16:49.550 --> 16:52.636
I grew up to be a beautiful wolf.

16:52.720 --> 16:53.721
A MODEL ON THE RISE
LEANNO

16:53.804 --> 16:57.224
I remember this. Grandpa's scrap book.

16:57.307 --> 16:59.518
These are from when I was a model.

16:59.601 --> 17:01.645
"Leanno the Gray Wolf."

17:01.729 --> 17:03.522
I was pretty popular.

17:04.148 --> 17:05.149
I can see why.

17:05.691 --> 17:07.443
Those were my glory days.

17:08.277 --> 17:09.111
That's why...

17:12.531 --> 17:17.536
I can't tell people
that my father is a Komodo dragon!

17:17.619 --> 17:18.454
I'm sorry.

17:20.497 --> 17:22.082
You have nothing to apologize for.

17:22.791 --> 17:26.628
We can share food
without worrying about my venom.

17:26.712 --> 17:29.131
We can eat together.

17:29.214 --> 17:31.175
That's more than enough to make me happy.

17:31.967 --> 17:33.177
You do as you please.

17:35.304 --> 17:37.056
<i>He loved me so much.</i>

17:39.141 --> 17:41.393
<i>But I was always scared.</i>

17:42.311 --> 17:47.316
<i>Scared of the Komodo dragon blood
running through my body.</i>

17:54.073 --> 17:55.074
I look good.

18:03.540 --> 18:08.921
<i>The doctors told me I had a rare case
of some age-dependent genetic condition.</i>

18:09.004 --> 18:11.256
<i>They said there was no cure.</i>

18:13.884 --> 18:15.219
<i>Look at her!</i>

18:15.761 --> 18:17.054
<i>Gross!</i>

18:17.763 --> 18:18.972
<i>Don't get too close.</i>

18:19.765 --> 18:21.225
<i>Disgusting.</i>

18:21.892 --> 18:23.477
<i>She's venomous. Don't touch her.</i>

18:24.228 --> 18:25.896
<i>She's dangerous. Kill her.</i>

18:26.730 --> 18:27.815
<i>Stay away.</i>

18:27.898 --> 18:29.149
<i>Die.</i>

18:34.488 --> 18:36.406
<i>Neither wolf nor lizard.</i>

18:37.324 --> 18:38.617
<i>That's right.</i>

18:38.700 --> 18:40.202
<i>In this world,</i>

18:41.036 --> 18:43.288
<i>I was an anomaly without a name.</i>

18:45.833 --> 18:46.917
<i>A freak of nature.</i>

18:49.628 --> 18:50.546
<i>So I...</i>

19:19.700 --> 19:21.451
<i>The night before I killed myself,</i>

19:22.494 --> 19:25.247
<i>I came to your bed
and slept there for a while.</i>

19:27.291 --> 19:28.625
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

19:28.709 --> 19:30.335
<i>I should have woken you up.</i>

19:31.086 --> 19:35.048
<i>I was a selfish mother until the end.</i>

19:36.884 --> 19:37.968
<i>I'm the one</i>

19:39.303 --> 19:40.304
<i>who should be sorry.</i>

19:40.387 --> 19:41.305
<i>What?</i>

19:41.388 --> 19:42.389
<i>That night,</i>

19:43.307 --> 19:44.516
<i>I was awake.</i>

19:45.893 --> 19:48.604
<i>Both your scales and your fur</i>

19:49.354 --> 19:50.689
<i>were so beautiful.</i>

19:50.772 --> 19:51.773
<i>What?</i>

19:52.399 --> 19:53.400
<i>Really?</i>

19:53.901 --> 19:55.444
<i>I wanted to nuzzle you.</i>

19:56.403 --> 19:58.197
<i>I wanted to turn over and hug you.</i>

19:59.364 --> 20:00.657
<i>I wanted you to hold me.</i>

20:01.867 --> 20:03.577
<i>Because you were my...</i>

20:04.369 --> 20:05.662
<i>my one and only mother.</i>

20:07.915 --> 20:08.999
<i>That makes me happy.</i>

20:10.626 --> 20:11.627
<i>Thank you.</i>

20:14.213 --> 20:15.214
Back then,

20:15.839 --> 20:18.634
I thought it'd be better
if I stayed quiet.

20:18.717 --> 20:21.136
I didn't think
you wanted me to look at you.

20:22.137 --> 20:24.014
You did?

20:24.097 --> 20:25.098
Yes.

20:27.309 --> 20:29.311
Why didn't I turn around?

20:31.021 --> 20:32.064
Mom.

20:32.731 --> 20:34.733
I should have told you that back then.

20:35.901 --> 20:36.985
Thank you.

20:38.320 --> 20:39.321
Maybe so.

20:40.072 --> 20:43.700
Maybe things would've been different
if I'd heard what you had to say.

20:45.327 --> 20:46.536
But...

20:46.620 --> 20:48.372
it's too late to bring me back.

20:49.414 --> 20:54.503
So, share those words with other mixes
who are struggling with themselves.

20:55.420 --> 20:56.630
Share your story.

20:57.673 --> 20:59.174
My story?

20:59.716 --> 21:01.969
That's right. Your story.

21:02.594 --> 21:04.888
The scars that cover your body.

21:05.514 --> 21:08.642
Each and every one tells your story.

21:11.395 --> 21:12.688
I see.

21:14.690 --> 21:17.150
I know what I have to do.

21:18.652 --> 21:19.903
Don't forget, Legoshi.

21:21.697 --> 21:24.241
With my blood and your grandfather's,

21:24.324 --> 21:27.119
you can become stronger
and kinder than anyone.

21:28.787 --> 21:29.830
Can I?

21:31.707 --> 21:34.418
I love you, Legoshi.

21:45.595 --> 21:46.930
Legoshi?

23:36.915 --> 23:41.920
Subtitle translation by: Thomas Grathwol
